Interview Questions
What is EC2?
Answer:
EC2 is a scalable virtual machine service that allows users to run applications on AWS infrastructure.
What is AMI?
Answer:
AMI is a template containing operating system and software configuration used to launch EC2 instances.
What is EBS?
Answer:
EBS is persistent block storage attached to EC2 instances.
Difference Between Stop and Terminate?
Stop
Plain Text
Server stops
EBS remains
Can start again
Terminate
Plain Text
Server deleted permanently
What is Security Group?
Answer:
Security Group acts as a stateful virtual firewall controlling inbound and outbound traffic.
Why IAM Role?
Answer:
IAM Roles provide temporary AWS permissions to EC2 instances without storing access keys.
How Do You Troubleshoot Website Down?
Answer:
Verify Route53.
Verify ALB.
Verify Target Group.
Verify EC2 health.
Verify Security Group.
Verify application status.
Check logs.
